# ═══════════════════════════════════════════
# PRODUCTS — PUT / PATCH / DELETE
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Оновити товар повністю (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/iphone-16-pro-256gb-black-titanium/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "category": "iphone",
  "name": "iPhone 16 Pro 512GB Black Titanium",
  "sku": "IPH-16PRO-512-BLK",
  "price": "64999.00",
  "stock": 5,
  "description": "Оновлений опис"
}

###

### Частково оновити ціну (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/iphone-16-pro-256gb-black-titanium/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "price": "49999.00",
  "old_price": "54999.00"
}

###

### Деактивувати товар (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/iphone-16-pro-256gb-black-titanium/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "is_active": false
}

###

### Видалити товар
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/iphone-16-pro-256gb-black-titanium/
